## 14. Data model preview

The first database can be SQLite.

Minimal tables:

```sql
CREATE TABLE project (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT,
  top TEXT,
  asil_target TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE endpoint (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  path TEXT,
  type TEXT,
  bit_width INTEGER,
  cone_size INTEGER
);

CREATE TABLE safety_mechanism (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT,
  ep_dc REAL,
  sp_dc REAL,
  cone_dc REAL
);

CREATE TABLE fault (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  node TEXT,
  fault_type TEXT,
  inject_time INTEGER,
  duration INTEGER
);

CREATE TABLE fault_result (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  fault_id INTEGER,
  result_class TEXT,
  fail_time INTEGER,
  alarm_time INTEGER,
  rationale TEXT
);
```

This database is not only for storage. It is the foundation for traceability.

Traceability matters because safety evidence must answer:

```text
Which design version?
Which safety mechanism?
Which fault list?
Which stimulus?
Which alarm?
Which result?
Which report?
```

